        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>・Run your own hot dog stand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 50 challenge levels and 10 story chapters it is time to put your grilling skills to the test. In a city crawling with secrets, orders piling up, and a galaxy of ingredients to choose from. Take on the culinary world with quirky combos and creative cart options. Prepare for every shift to be a chaotic delight.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/29abf86f8a1ce9c9350b9a5e62184ad8.poster.avif?t=1764936075\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/29abf86f8a1ce9c9350b9a5e62184ad8.webm?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/29abf86f8a1ce9c9350b9a5e62184ad8.mp4?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>・</strong> <strong>Assist the Galactic Tasteforce</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In their absurd but crucial mission to catalogue and research the preferences of alien tourists. Expect bizarre characters, intergalactic crazy customers, and serious space catastrophes. Agent: Tony spent two years growing a moustache for this mission and he's not backing down now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/a87b0ff8fd11e9614ec54a6ac87a08a2.poster.avif?t=1764936075\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/a87b0ff8fd11e9614ec54a6ac87a08a2.webm?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/a87b0ff8fd11e9614ec54a6ac87a08a2.mp4?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>・Uncover a mysterious global threat</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brewing beneath the surface, tension builds as the Galactic Tasteforce prepares for the potential arrival of something big, weird, and possibly mustard powered.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/5b4d9d27e5b24817000e8da61ca29910.avif?t=1764936075\" width=640 height=220 /></span><strong>・Spread of customisation options</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stand, tweak your menu, and kit yourself out with alien tech (don’t forget snazzy aprons).   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/13f887916b509838f1a7619c5b489f5c.poster.avif?t=1764936075\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/13f887916b509838f1a7619c5b489f5c.webm?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/13f887916b509838f1a7619c5b489f5c.mp4?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>・Play it your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple game modes you can focus on growing your food empire, going deep into the alien investigations, or even balance both as the plot thickens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/1f87b94c0b07e557d70a84864bb4597f.poster.avif?t=1764936075\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/1f87b94c0b07e557d70a84864bb4597f.webm?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/1f87b94c0b07e557d70a84864bb4597f.mp4?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>・Built with love and mustard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  This game was made by a solo developer with a love for food, comedy, and cosy indie chaos. <i>Hotdog Hazards</i> is a passion project blending the joy of silly conversations, sci-fi weirdness, and the simple pleasure of a well grilled hot dog. Built for chill vibes, second screen players, and most of all to bring you some laughs. Thank you for being a part of this community. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I did making it!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>・Run your own hot dog stand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 50 challenge levels and 10 story chapters it is time to put your grilling skills to the test. In a city crawling with secrets, orders piling up, and a galaxy of ingredients to choose from. Take on the culinary world with quirky combos and creative cart options. Prepare for every shift to be a chaotic delight.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/29abf86f8a1ce9c9350b9a5e62184ad8.poster.avif?t=1764936075\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/29abf86f8a1ce9c9350b9a5e62184ad8.webm?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/29abf86f8a1ce9c9350b9a5e62184ad8.mp4?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>・</strong> <strong>Assist the Galactic Tasteforce</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In their absurd but crucial mission to catalogue and research the preferences of alien tourists. Expect bizarre characters, intergalactic crazy customers, and serious space catastrophes. Agent: Tony spent two years growing a moustache for this mission and he's not backing down now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/a87b0ff8fd11e9614ec54a6ac87a08a2.poster.avif?t=1764936075\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/a87b0ff8fd11e9614ec54a6ac87a08a2.webm?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/a87b0ff8fd11e9614ec54a6ac87a08a2.mp4?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>・Uncover a mysterious global threat</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brewing beneath the surface, tension builds as the Galactic Tasteforce prepares for the potential arrival of something big, weird, and possibly mustard powered.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/5b4d9d27e5b24817000e8da61ca29910.avif?t=1764936075\" width=640 height=220 /></span><strong>・Spread of customisation options</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stand, tweak your menu, and kit yourself out with alien tech (don’t forget snazzy aprons).   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/13f887916b509838f1a7619c5b489f5c.poster.avif?t=1764936075\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/13f887916b509838f1a7619c5b489f5c.webm?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/13f887916b509838f1a7619c5b489f5c.mp4?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>・Play it your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple game modes you can focus on growing your food empire, going deep into the alien investigations, or even balance both as the plot thickens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/1f87b94c0b07e557d70a84864bb4597f.poster.avif?t=1764936075\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/1f87b94c0b07e557d70a84864bb4597f.webm?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884010/extras/1f87b94c0b07e557d70a84864bb4597f.mp4?t=1764936075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>・Built with love and mustard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  This game was made by a solo developer with a love for food, comedy, and cosy indie chaos. <i>Hotdog Hazards</i> is a passion project blending the joy of silly conversations, sci-fi weirdness, and the simple pleasure of a well grilled hot dog. Built for chill vibes, second screen players, and most of all to bring you some laughs. Thank you for being a part of this community. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I did making it!</p>",
        "short_description": "Hotdog Hazards puts you in Tony's shoes, a highly trained grill master and undercover agent for the Galactic Tasteforce. Save the world by serving hot dogs to alien tourists, or fight for survival one hot dog at a time in challenge mode. Wishlist now to prepare for the grill of a lifetime.",
